LavenderTown_Text_DoYouBelieveInGhosts::
    .string "Do you believe in ghosts?$"

LavenderTown_Text_SoThereAreBelievers::
    .string "Really?\n"
    .string "So there are believers…$"

LavenderTown_Text_JustImaginingWhiteHand::
    .string "Hahaha, I guess not.\p"
    .string "That white hand on your shoulder…\n"
    .string "I'm just imagining it.$"

LavenderTown_Text_TownKnownAsMonGraveSite::
    .string "Men in black tried to steal the\n"
    .string "SPINEL at the top of the TOWER!\p"
    .string "The dead rose against them. Now\n"
    .string "the whole TOWER is haunted.$"

LavenderTown_Text_GhostsAppearedInTower::
    .string "Ghosts walk the POKéMON TOWER\n"
    .string "since the thieves tried their luck.\p"
    .string "MR. FUJI, the keeper, went up to\n"
    .string "calm them. He is very brave.$"

LavenderTown_Text_TownSign::
    .string "SPINELLIA\n"
    .string "The Spinel Tower Town$"

LavenderTown_Text_PoliceClosed::
    .string "POLICEMAN: Thieves tried to take\n"
    .string "the SPINEL, and woke the dead.\p"
    .string "The town is sealed until the TOWER\n"
    .string "is calm. MR. FUJI is at the top.$"

LavenderTown_Text_PoliceOpen::
    .string "POLICEMAN: A powerful man in black\n"
    .string "took the SPINEL, we heard.\p"
    .string "The roads are open again. Be\n"
    .string "careful out there!$"

LavenderTown_Text_SilphScopeNotice::
    .string "NOTICE!\n"
    .string "The TOWER's spirits are restless.\p"
    .string "Enter at your own risk.\n"
    .string "SPINELLIA POLICE$"

LavenderTown_Text_VolunteerPokemonHouse::
    .string "SPINELLIA VOLUNTEER\n"
    .string "POKéMON HOUSE$"

LavenderTown_Text_PokemonTowerSign::
    .string "POKéMON TOWER\n"
    .string "Becalm the Spirits of POKéMON$"


LavenderTown_Text_RefAsk::
    .string "FINN: The old tower is full of lost\n"
    .string "POKéMON. Hunters know it, and they\n"
    .string "come at dusk with lanterns.$"

LavenderTown_Text_RefHunter1::
    .string "HUNTER: Rare ones fetch a fortune!\n"
    .string "Stay out of this, child!$"

LavenderTown_Text_RefHunter2::
    .string "HUNTER: You beat my partner? Fine,\n"
    .string "I am not afraid of a ranger!$"

LavenderTown_Text_RefGives::
    .string "FINN: You saved the day. The post\n"
    .string "has a gift for you: PORYGON!$"

LavenderTown_Text_RefAfter::
    .string "FINN: Take good care of it. The\n"
    .string "next REFUGE post is waiting.$"

LavenderTown_Text_RefEarly::
    .string "FINN: Not yet. Finish the earlier\n"
    .string "posts first. The KEEPER at the\n"
    .string "SAFARI ZONE knows the order.$"

LavenderTown_Text_RefDone::
    .string "FINN: Thank you again. The REFUGE\n"
    .string "is safer because of you.$"

LavenderTown_Text_RefIdle::
    .string "FINN: I watch over the animals here.\n"
    .string "The world is quieter now.$"

LavenderTown_Text_ProcheNathan_Intro::
	.string "{PLAYER}. I felt you coming. This\n"
	.string "town keeps its secrets... and so\p"
	.string "does my team.$"

LavenderTown_Text_ProcheNathan_Defeat::
	.string "Even the dead cheer for you...$"

LavenderTown_Text_ProcheNathan_Win::
	.string "Take it. It whispers your name.$"

LavenderTown_Text_ProcheNathan_After::
	.string "Some shadows are only friends in\n"
	.string "disguise.$"

LavenderTown_Text_ProcheNathan_Early::
	.string "Not yet, {PLAYER}. Return with all 8\n"
	.string "BADGES.$"

LavenderTown_Text_ProcheNathan_NoRoom::
	.string "Your BAG is full. Make some room\n"
	.string "first, then talk to me again.$"
